  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Traditional Handicraft and Handloom Revival and Economic Advancement through Durable Solutions in Tiger Landscapes (THREADS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Civil society organisations build synergy to contribute to reviving and strengthening the viability of traditional handloom and related handicraft through women&#xbf;s leadership and gender mainstreaming to boost economic, environmental, and cultural resilience in the forest-bordering regions of the Brahmaputra Landscapes in Northeast India and the Terai Landscapes in North India.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
